OL,3,GNEWSARow over plans for Southport Town
OL,4,AHall gardens
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouthport's Civic Society has said it
OL,7,Fwill object to plans to regenerate the
OL,8,FTown Hall gardens.
OL,10,FThe #10m plan to create a
OL,11,Ffamily-friendly performance space on
OL,12,Fthe site was inspired by three girls
OL,13,Fwho were killed in a knife attack in
OL,14,Fthe town in 2024.
OL,16,FThe Civic Society said the proposals
OL,17,Finclude demolishing the garden's two
OL,18,Fpavilions along with historic lights
OL,19,Fand balustrades, and it wants the
OL,20,Fauthority to re-consider.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
