OL,3,GNEWSARow over plans for Southport Town
OL,4,AHall gardens
OL,5,
OL,6,FSefton Council leader Marion Atkinson
OL,7,Ftold the BBC there had already been
OL,8,Fseveral stages of public consultation
OL,9,Fand that "all views would be listened
OL,10,Fto".
